    "Down the right-hand edge, clear of a Dock on that side.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沿右邊緣，避開那一側的 Dock。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Down the left-hand edge, clear of a Dock on that side.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沿左邊緣，避開那一側的 Dock。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A wide bar across the top, readings side by side. On a Mac with a notch of its own it runs up to meet it, so the two read as one shape.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "頂部一條橫欄，讀值並排。有硬體瀏海的 Mac 上會貼上去，看起來像同一塊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A wide bar resting on top of the Dock, readings side by side.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一條橫欄壓在 Dock 上方，讀值並排。"
