    "Check now": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即檢查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App designed and developed by": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 設計與開發"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect an assistant to get started": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連結一個助理，即可開始使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codenotch never signs in — each reading is borrowed from the tool that already holds the account. Signing out here stops the credential being read and forgets the numbers, but leaves you signed in to that tool. macOS asks once per tool the first time, and again whenever you sign in to a different account; Always Allow keeps it quiet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codenotch 從不自己登入 — 每條讀值都借自已經持有該帳號的工具。在這裡登出只會停止讀取憑證並忘掉數字，你在那個工具裡仍然是登入狀態。macOS 每種工具第一次會問一次，換帳號再登入時還會再問；選「一律允許」就不會再打擾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codenotch reads usage from tools already signed in on this Mac — it never asks for your password. Install and sign in to any of Claude Code (the terminal tool, not the Claude app), Cursor, Codex, Antigravity, GLM, Grok or OpenCode, and its ring appears in the notch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codenotch 讀取這台 Mac 上已經登入的工具的用量 — 從不問你的密碼。安裝並登入 Claude Code（終端機工具，不是 Claude App）、Cursor、Codex、Antigravity、GLM、Grok 或 OpenCode 中的任意一個，瀏海裡就會出現對應的圓環。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS will ask once for permission to read Claude Code's and Antigravity's saved logins. Choose Always Allow — plain Allow makes it ask again every time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 會詢問一次，是否允許讀取 Claude Code 和 Antigravity 已儲存的登入資訊。請選「一律允許」— 只選「允許」的話，每次都會再問。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@. Updates install in the background and apply next time Codenotch starts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@。更新在背景安裝，下次啟動 Codenotch 時生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signed out — nothing is read, and no readings are kept.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已登出 — 不再讀取，也不再儲存讀值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow access…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允許存取…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切換…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks macOS for %@'s saved login again. Choose Always Allow and it will stop asking.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再次向 macOS 請求 %@ 已儲存的登入資訊。選「一律允許」就不會再問。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch off to stop reading %@ and forget its readings. %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關閉後停止讀取 %@，並清除已儲存的讀值。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch on to sign in and read %@ again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟以重新登入並讀取 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS is not letting Codenotch read %@'s saved login. Choose Allow access… above, then Always Allow.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 不讓 Codenotch 讀取 %@ 已儲存的登入資訊。點上面的「允許存取…」，然後選「一律允許」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens %@, which is where this account is signed in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟 %@，這個帳號就是在那裡登入的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens %@ in your browser. That site has its own sign-in, separate from the credential read here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在瀏覽器開啟 %@。那個網站有自己的登入，和這裡讀取的憑證不是一回事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
