    "Run grok login — it signs in and refreshes the token this reads.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "執行 grok login，完成登入並更新此處使用的權杖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Usage rides on the opencode-go key OpenCode stores on sign-in — connect Go inside OpenCode (`opencode auth login`) and the notch reads it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用量走的是 OpenCode 登入時儲存的 opencode-go 金鑰 — 在 OpenCode 裡接通 Go（`opencode auth login`），瀏海就會讀到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Usage rides on a Z.ai GLM Coding Plan key held by a coding tool — Claude Code's settings.json, ZCode or OpenCode. Set one up there and the notch reads it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用量走的是某個程式開發工具裡的 Z.ai GLM Coding Plan 金鑰 — Claude Code 的 settings.json、ZCode 或 OpenCode。在那邊配好，瀏海就會讀到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run `%@` once — it signs in and refreshes the token this reads. Use /login there to change account.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "執行一次 `%@`，完成登入並更新此處使用的權杖。若要切換帳號，請在該工具中使用 /login。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlimited on the %@ plan — nothing to meter": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 方案無限制 — 沒有可計量的額度"
