      }
    },
    "Version %@ is available and will install shortly.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@ 可用，即將安裝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't reach the update server. Codenotch will try again on its own — nothing is wrong with this copy.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連不上更新伺服器。Codenotch 會自己再試 — 這份安裝沒有問題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two more providers, and a live account plan that was silently dropped.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "又多了兩個服務，以及一個被悄悄丟掉的真實帳號方案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grok is a new ring": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grok 成了新的圓環"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SuperGrok's weekly Grok Build allowance, read from the same billing endpoint the CLI uses, with the session in ~/.grok/auth.json.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SuperGrok 的每週 Grok Build 額度，讀取 CLI 所用的同一個計費端點，工作階段來自 ~/.grok/auth.json。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenCode's Go plan is a new ring": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenCode 的 Go 方案成了新的圓環"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads the Go plan's official usage endpoint with the key OpenCode itself stores on sign-in — no second sign-in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 OpenCode 登入時自己存下的金鑰讀取 Go 方案官方用量端點 — 不用再登一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A real Codex account went unmetered": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一個真實的 Codex 帳號變成了未計量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex's live reading only recognised a 5-hour and a 7-day window. A free-plan account's real limit was a 30-day one, which fell through unnoticed and showed as nothing metered on an account that was genuinely tracked.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 的即時讀值只認 5 小時和 7 天視窗。免費方案帳號真正的額度是 30 天，被悄悄漏掉，一個確實在計量的帳號顯示成沒有可計量的額度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switching a provider off now really stops it": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關掉某個服務現在真的會停掉"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opening Settings could still read a switched-off provider's account, and a reply already in flight could restore a reading you had just asked it to forget.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟設定仍可能讀取已關閉服務的帳號，一次還在路上的回覆也可能把你剛讓它忘掉的讀值加回來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Contributors can build without a certificate": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "貢獻者可以在沒有憑證的情況下建置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "make build and make test now sign themselves automatically when the maintainer's Developer ID isn't present — no Apple account needed to work on this.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "維護者的 Developer ID 不在時，make build 和 make test 會自動簽署 — 參與開發不需要 Apple 帳號。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waking from sleep no longer erases a reading.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從睡眠喚醒不再抹掉讀值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A ring survives waking your Mac": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "喚醒 Mac 後圓環還在"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A brief window right after sleep, where macOS won't allow a keychain prompt yet, was mistaken for being signed out — which erased the reading and left \"waiting for the first reading\" on screen. It now ages the number instead of throwing it away, and picks back up on its own.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "剛睡醒的一小段時間裡 macOS 還不允許鑰匙圈提示，這被誤當成已登出 — 讀值被抹掉，螢幕上只剩「正在等待首次讀值」。現在會讓數字變舊而不是扔掉，並自己恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two more accounts, four community fixes, and honest duplicates.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "又多了兩個帳號，四個社群修復，以及誠實的重複項。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Multiple Claude Code accounts": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "多個 Claude Code 帳號"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep a work login apart with CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR? It now gets its own ring, its own limits, and its own row in Settings, beside your personal one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR 把工作登入分開？它現在有自己的圓環、自己的額度，以及設定裡自己的一行，就在個人帳號旁邊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GLM added": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "加入了 GLM"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Z.ai's Coding Plan reads live now too, with a key borrowed from whichever tool already holds one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Z.ai 的 Coding Plan 現在也即時讀取，金鑰借自已經持有它的那個工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A stuck Claude ring recovers on its own": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卡住的 Claude 圓環會自己恢復"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One momentary failure — the Mac waking from sleep, most often — used to lock the ring until the app restarted. It now clears itself on the next check.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次短暫失敗 — 多半是 Mac 從睡眠喚醒 — 以前會把圓環鎖死直到重啟 App。現在下次檢查會自己解開。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cursor sessions stop reporting work that already ended": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cursor 工作階段不再把已經結束的工作報成還在進行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A crashed or abandoned chat could read as \"still working\" for a day or more. It now notices when the writing has actually stopped.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "崩潰或棄掉的對話可能一整天都顯示「仍在工作」。現在會發現寫入其實已經停了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A months-old duplicate can no longer win": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "幾個月前的重複項再也搶不贏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code files a new keychain entry on every token rotation. An account signed in for a while could pick an old, expired one at random and show \"waiting for the first reading\" forever.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 每次輪換權杖都會寫一條新的鑰匙圈。登入較久的帳號可能隨機拿到過期的那條，然後永遠顯示「正在等待首次讀值」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A stray click no longer pins the notch open": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "誤點不再把瀏海釘在展開狀態"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clicking near the screen edge before the notch had even opened could leave it stuck open with nothing on screen explaining why.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "瀏海還沒展開時點到螢幕邊緣，可能讓它卡在開啟狀態，螢幕上卻沒有任何解釋。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex reads live, and Always show stays on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 改為即時讀取，「一律顯示」會保持開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex is read live instead of from a log": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 改為即時讀取，而不再讀紀錄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The figure came from a file Codex writes during a turn, so it was as old as the last time you used it — three days stale in one case. Codenotch now asks Codex itself, and matches its own panel.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "數字來自 Codex 在一輪對話裡寫的檔案，所以有多舊取決於你上次用它是什麼時候 — 有一次舊了三天。Codenotch 現在直接問 Codex，並與它自己的面板一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Codex ring notices the desktop app": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 圓環會注意到桌面 App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It only ever watched the files the CLI and the VS Code extension write, so work done in the desktop app never made it spin.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以前只盯 CLI 和 VS Code 擴充功能寫的檔案，桌面 App 裡的工作從不會讓它轉起來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always show no longer turns itself off": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「一律顯示」不再自己關掉"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clicking the notch toggled the same flag the setting used, so a stray click quietly put it back to showing on hover.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點選瀏海會撥動設定用的同一個開關，一次誤點就會悄悄變回游標停留時顯示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Far fewer keychain prompts": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鑰匙圈提示少得多"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a token expired, every check went back to the keychain — a prompt a minute. It now reads the secret only when the owning app has changed it, and never retries a refusal on a timer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "權杖一過期，每次檢查都回到鑰匙圈 — 一分鐘彈一次。現在只在所屬 App 改過金鑰時才讀，並且不會按定時器重試一次拒絕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A paused limit is shown as paused": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暫停的額度會顯示為暫停"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some limits are reached while the headline still shows room. The ring reads as spent and says when it lifts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有些額度已經用盡，標題卻還顯示有餘量。圓環會顯示用完，並說明何時解除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Long messages are no longer cut off": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "長訊息不再被截斷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tooltip with something to explain reserved one line for it however much it said.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有話要說的提示只給它留了一行，不管它寫了多少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every session, and a tooltip that fits on the screen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一個工作階段，以及一張能放進螢幕的提示卡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tooltips are no longer cut off": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示卡不再被截斷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A card is centred on the ring it belongs to, so the first and last providers threw half of it past the end of the panel — and what fell off was the title. The panel now keeps room for it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卡片以所屬圓環為中心，第一個和最後一個服務會把一半甩出面板 — 掉出去的還是標題。面板現在會給它留位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As many sessions as your screen can hold": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "螢幕能放下多少工作階段就顯示多少"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list was capped at four whatever you were running on. It is now solved for the display: ten on a large one, and \"and N more\" only when there is genuinely no room for the rest.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不論你在跑什麼，清單以前最多四條。現在按螢幕算：大螢幕十條，只有真的放不下時才出現「還有 N 個」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ones that need you come first": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要你的排在前面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting, then busy, then idle — so if anything is summarised away, it is what matters least.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待中，然後工作中，然後閒置 — 被收進「還有 N 個」的，是最不要緊的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Antigravity's real numbers, and a switch that stays off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Antigravity 的真實數字，以及一個會保持關閉的開關。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Antigravity shows its actual quota": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Antigravity 顯示真實配額"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google will not answer Codenotch directly, so it asks Antigravity's own language server instead — the same place Antigravity's usage panel gets its figure.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Google 不會直接回答 Codenotch，所以改問 Antigravity 自己的語言伺服器 — 也就是 Antigravity 用量面板取數字的地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Usage reads both ways": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用量從兩頭都能讀懂"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"12% used · 88% left\", so a reading lines up with whichever end your vendor happens to show.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「12% 已用 · 88% 剩餘」，讀值能對上供應商碰巧展示的那一端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A way back from a declined keychain prompt": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拒絕鑰匙圈提示之後還有退路"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Declining no longer looks like being signed out, and Allow access… asks macOS again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拒絕不再看起來像已登出，「允許存取…」會再問一次 macOS。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switching a provider off now sticks": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關掉某個服務現在會記住"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stopped being read but its last reading was kept, so the ring came back at the next launch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不再讀取，但上次讀值還留著，所以下次啟動圓環又回來了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Distant resets show a date": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "很遠的重置會顯示日期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A limit renewing in four weeks said \"Mon\", which read as this Monday. It says \"28 Sep\".": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "四週後才更新的額度以前寫「Mon」，讀起來像本週一。現在寫「9月28日」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first release.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首個版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Put the notch anywhere": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "瀏海可以放在任意一邊"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Right, left, top or bottom. It keeps clear of the Dock and the menu bar, and follows when the Dock moves.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "右、左、上或下。會避開 Dock 和選單列，Dock 移動時跟著走。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It joins your Mac's own notch": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它會接上 Mac 自己的瀏海"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the top edge it takes the hardware's shape, so the two read as one rather than as a bar parked underneath.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放在頂部時會採用硬體的形狀，兩者讀起來是一塊，而不是停在下面的一條。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude, Cursor, Codex and Gemini": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude、Cursor、Codex 和 Gemini"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each read from the tool already signed in on this Mac. Codenotch never asks for a password.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各自讀取這台 Mac 上已經登入的工具。Codenotch 從不問密碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose where Codenotch appears": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選擇 Codenotch 出現在哪裡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the Dock, in the menu bar, or nowhere at all.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Dock、在選單列，或者哪裡都不出現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codenotch": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codenotch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@%% Used · %@%% left": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@%% 已用 · %@%% 剩餘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ left": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "剩餘 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ used": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已用 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in with GitHub CLI to read your Copilot usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
