          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "固定在 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That display is disconnected. Codenotch follows the active window until it returns.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "該顯示器已中斷連線。重新連接前，Codenotch 會跟隨使用中的視窗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to reorder. The notch draws the rings in this order.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖曳以改順序。瀏海按這個順序畫圓環。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch this on to give it a ring in the notch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
