      }
    },
    "Alert when %@ crosses 80% and 100% of a limit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "當 %@ 的額度越過 80% 和 100% 時提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fills the ring against a ceiling you choose; Google publishes none for an API key.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按你設定的上限填充圓環；Google 不為 API 金鑰公布額度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codenotch reads usage from tools already signed in on this Mac — it never asks for your password. Install and sign in to any of Claude Code (the terminal tool, not the Claude app), Cursor (the editor or cursor-agent), Codex, Antigravity, GLM, Grok, OpenCode, GitHub Copilot or a Gemini API key (via Gemini CLI, OpenCode or Hermes), and its ring appears in the notch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codenotch 讀取這台 Mac 上已經登入的工具的用量 — 從不問你的密碼。安裝並登入 Claude Code（終端機工具，不是 Claude App）、Cursor（編輯器或 cursor-agent）、Codex、Antigravity、GLM、Grok、OpenCode、GitHub Copilot 或 Gemini API 金鑰（經由 Gemini CLI、OpenCode 或 Hermes）中的任意一個，瀏海裡就會出現對應的圓環。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS will ask once for permission to read Claude Code's, Antigravity's and cursor-agent's saved logins. Choose Always Allow — plain Allow makes it ask again every time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 會詢問一次，是否允許讀取 Claude Code、Antigravity 和 cursor-agent 已儲存的登入資訊。請選「一律允許」— 只選「允許」的話，每次都會再問。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reorder the rings, pick a display, and get told when a limit is close.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以重排圓環、選擇顯示器，額度快用盡時會通知你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to reorder the rings": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖曳以重排圓環"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings splits into Connected and Not connected; drag a connected row by its handle to change the order the notch draws them in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定分成「已連線」和「未連線」；拖曳已連線行的控制點，即可改變瀏海繪製順序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pin the notch to one display, or show it on every one": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把瀏海釘在一台顯示器上，或在每一台上顯示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Displays picker in Appearance offers the main display or all of them; a second picker pins a single notch to a named screen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外觀裡的「顯示器」可選主顯示器或全部；第二個選擇器把單個瀏海釘在指定螢幕上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A ring says when it crosses 80% and 100%": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "圓環越過 80% 和 100% 時會說明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A system notification once per crossing, muted per provider from its own settings row.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次越過發一條系統通知，可在該服務自己的設定行裡靜音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub Copilot is a new ring": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub Copilot 成了新的圓環"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads GitHub's Copilot quota endpoint using the GitHub CLI session already on the Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用這台 Mac 上已有的 GitHub CLI 工作階段讀取 Copilot 配額端點。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Say when a session ends": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作階段結束時會告訴你"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The notch opens itself for a few seconds and sounds a chime when an agent stops working or starts waiting on you; a click jumps to it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "助手停止工作或開始等你時，瀏海會自己開啟幾秒並響一聲；點選會跳過去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌥-drag the pill along its edge": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住 ⌥ 沿邊緣拖曳膠囊"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nudge it clear of another menu-bar app anchored to the same spot; remembered per edge.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把它挪開，避開釘在同一位置的其他選單列 App；按邊緣記住。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose an accent colour": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選擇強調色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device accent by default, or a fixed colour for the ring's positive state — the amber and red warning colours stay fixed regardless.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設用裝置強調色，也可以給圓環的正常狀態固定一個顏色 — 琥珀和紅色警告色一律不變。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A countdown instead of a reset date": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用倒數計時代替重置日期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appearance's Reset time picker can show \"Resets in 3h 20m\" instead of a date and time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外觀裡的「重置時間」可以顯示「3 小時 20 分鐘後重置」，而不是日期和時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read Cursor from cursor-agent, and enterprise plans correctly": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以從 cursor-agent 讀取 Cursor，企業方案也能讀對"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A CLI-only Cursor login now gets a ring, and enterprise/team plans read their real usage instead of reporting nothing to meter.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只用 CLI 登入的 Cursor 現在也有圓環；企業/團隊方案會讀到真實用量，而不再顯示沒有可計量的額度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fewer keychain prompts for Claude and Antigravity": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude 和 Antigravity 的鑰匙圈提示更少"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude reads its own CLI's /usage first, touching the keychain only as a fallback; Antigravity's language server is asked before it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude 優先讀取自身 CLI 的 /usage，無法取得時才讀取鑰匙圈；Antigravity 則優先向自身的語言伺服器查詢。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sub-1% usage no longer reads as 0%": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不到 1% 的用量不再顯示成 0%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reading under one percent shows a tenth (\"<0.1%\") instead of rounding to nothing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不到百分之一的讀值會顯示到十分位（「<0.1%」），而不是四捨五入成零。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Contributors can build without Xcode signing": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "貢獻者可以在沒有 Xcode 簽署的情況下建置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "make build and make test sign themselves automatically when the maintainer's certificate isn't present, and CI now runs the suite on every push and pull request.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "維護者憑證不在時，make build 和 make test 會自動簽署；CI 現在會在每次 push 和 pull request 上跑測試套件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow System": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟隨系統"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Matches the Mac's preferred language.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Mac 的偏好語言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codenotch uses this language even if the Mac does not.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codenotch 固定使用此語言，不受 Mac 的語言設定影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Language": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "語言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show usage pace": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顯示用量節奏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compares each timed allowance with the time left until reset, showing quota in deficit or held in reserve.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把每段有時限的額度與距離重置的時間比較，顯示透支還是留有餘量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Size": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Medium": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Large": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Takes the least room on the edge. Readable, but not from across the desk.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "占用最少的螢幕邊緣空間，適合近距離閱讀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The size the notch was drawn at.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "瀏海的原始設計尺寸。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Easier to read at a glance, and harder to ignore.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字更清楚，動態也更醒目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold ⌥ and drag the notch to slide it along its edge. Each edge remembers where you left it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住 ⌥ 拖曳瀏海，沿邊緣滑動。每條邊都會記住你放的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recentre": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新置中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@% deficit": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@% 透支"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@% reserved": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@% 預留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Idle": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "閒置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in to Codex in ~/.codex-%@ to read your usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 ~/.codex-%@ 登入 Codex 以讀取用量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in with the Command Code app to read your usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 Command Code App 登入以讀取用量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter an Ollama API key in Settings, or export OLLAMA_API_KEY": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在設定中輸入 Ollama API 金鑰，或設定 OLLAMA_API_KEY 環境變數"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start Ollama to monitor your local models": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "啟動 Ollama 以監測本機模型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter an Ollama API key below, or export OLLAMA_API_KEY in your shell.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在下方輸入 Ollama API 金鑰，或在 shell 中設定 OLLAMA_API_KEY 環境變數。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in with the Command Code app — it writes ~/.commandcode/auth.json and the notch reads it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 Command Code App 登入 — 它會寫入 ~/.commandcode/auth.json，瀏海會讀它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Command Code has nothing metered on this account yet": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個 Command Code 帳號目前沒有可計量的額度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Monthly usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每月用量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Session usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作階段用量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weekly usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每週用量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local Models": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本機模型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Localhost": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本機"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codenotch reads usage from tools already signed in on this Mac — it never asks for your password. Install and sign in to any of Claude Code (the terminal tool, not the Claude app), Cursor (the editor or cursor-agent), Codex, Antigravity, GLM, Grok, OpenCode, Command Code, GitHub Copilot or a Gemini API key (via Gemini CLI, OpenCode or Hermes), and its ring appears in the notch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codenotch 讀取這台 Mac 上已經登入的工具的用量 — 從不問你的密碼。安裝並登入 Claude Code（終端機工具，不是 Claude App）、Cursor（編輯器或 cursor-agent）、Codex、Antigravity、GLM、Grok、OpenCode、Command Code、GitHub Copilot 或 Gemini API 金鑰（經由 Gemini CLI、OpenCode 或 Hermes）中的任意一個，瀏海裡就會出現對應的圓環。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A ready-made download, no Xcode needed": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直接下載使用，不需要 Xcode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A session launched from Claude for Mac now reaches the notch like any other. The sign-in also renews itself in the background, so a ring stops ageing out after a week of use.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從 Claude for Mac 啟動的工作階段，現在也會顯示在瀏海中。登入憑證也會在背景更新，避免使用一週後圓環的資料便不再更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A system notification the moment a provider's headline limit crosses 80%, and again at 100% — once per crossing, and again only after the window rolls over. Mute one from the bell beside its row in Accounts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服務的主要額度用量達到 80% 和 100% 時，各發送一次系統通知；下一個用量週期才會再次通知。可點選「帳號」中各列旁的鈴鐺，關閉該服務的通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An install with no desktop app is a real account rather than a missing one, and its daily quota is read directly.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即使只安裝 CLI，也能辨識帳號並直接讀取每日額度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Antigravity reads a CLI-only install": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Antigravity 支援僅安裝 CLI 的環境"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attached to the bottom screen edge. Option-drag to move left or right.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "貼齊螢幕下緣。按住 Option 拖曳，即可左右移動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attached to the left-hand screen edge. Option-drag to move up or down.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "貼齊螢幕左緣。按住 Option 拖曳，即可上下移動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attached to the right-hand screen edge. Option-drag to move up or down.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "貼齊螢幕右緣。按住 Option 拖曳，即可上下移動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code sessions started from the desktop app are counted": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "納入從桌面 App 啟動的 Claude Code 工作階段"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codenotch already knows the moment an agent stops working or stops to ask you something. Clicking the notch while it is open brings that session's app to the front — the app, not the tab: only some terminals let anything outside them choose a tab, so the tooltip names the session instead.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理完成工作或停下來詢問你時，Codenotch 就會得知。瀏海展開時，點選即可將該工作階段的 App 帶到最前方；只有部分終端機允許外部程式切換分頁，因此提示卡會顯示工作階段名稱，方便你找到它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cursor stops showing work that finished months ago": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cursor 不再顯示幾個月前就已完成的工作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Custom": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自訂"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each loaded model gets its own cell, with the tokens per second of its last response and a mark while it is thinking. The measurement is taken locally and nothing about a prompt leaves the machine.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每個已載入的模型都有獨立區塊，顯示上次回覆每秒產生的 token 數，並在思考時顯示標記。效能在本機測量，提示內容不會傳出電腦。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every build now produces an app bundle you can run, so trying Codenotch no longer starts with a developer setup.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次建置都會產生可直接執行的 App，試用 Codenotch 不必先準備開發環境。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finished background agents were leaving the ring amber indefinitely. Only a real, current chat counts as waiting now.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已完成的背景代理曾讓圓環一直呈現琥珀色。現在只有仍在進行、確實需要回應的對話才會顯示為等待中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hidden from the notch · Loaded in Ollama": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "瀏海中已隱藏 · Ollama 中仍已載入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It turns and presses in as it is clicked, and a second click closes Settings rather than doing nothing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點選時，齒輪會旋轉並下壓；再次點選則會關閉設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Ollama usage recorded yet for this period.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這段期間尚無 Ollama 用量紀錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No hairline of wallpaper behind it at any size, and it stays anchored while the size slider is dragged instead of drifting and catching up at the end.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任何尺寸都會緊貼邊緣，不再露出桌布細縫。拖曳尺寸滑桿時也會維持位置，不會先偏移、放開後才對齊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ollama models show thinking and generation speed": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ollama 模型可顯示思考狀態與生成速度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preset": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設尺寸"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set the size by slider as well as by preset": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可用滑桿或預設尺寸調整大小"
