    "This is the same ChatGPT account as %@. It was not added a second time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這與 %@ 是同一個 ChatGPT 帳號，沒有重複新增。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a weekly limit resets, Codenotch sends one small request to start the new countdown, so an allowance is not left unclaimed while you are away. It spends a little of that allowance to do it, stands aside whenever you are already working on the account, and never touches an account it cannot confirm.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每週限額重置時，Codenotch 會送出一次小請求啟動新的倒數，避免你不在時整週額度就這樣空著。這會花掉一點該週額度；你正在使用該帳號時它會讓開，也絕不碰無法確認身分的帳號。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not sent — the command this account is read through is not installed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未送出——讀取這個帳號所需的指令沒有安裝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
