            "value": "模擬檢查：符合啟動每週倒數的條件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The check failed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "檢查失敗：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is signed in. Its usage now appears under Codex.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已登入，額度已顯示在 Codex 明細中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When safe, sends a minimal request to start the weekly countdown. Refresh only reads usage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "符合安全條件時，會送出最小請求啟動每週倒數。「重新整理」則只讀取額度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start 5-hour windows once": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "單次啟動 5 小時倒數"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taiwan time": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "台灣時間"
          }
